---
/**
 * Evolus recognition plate — client direction 2026-07-30 ("a bold black
 * marquee or box, with pink letters"): a STATIC noir plate, deliberately
 * not a scrolling marquee (that experiment shipped and was rejected on
 * sight, 2026-07-08 — motion stays within the sanctioned vocabulary).
 *
 * COMPLIANCE — read before editing the statement:
 * - "Charlotte's #1 Evolus provider" is an exact-match allowedStrings
 *   entry (third authorization, DECISIONS 2026-07-21). The linter strips
 *   it PER SOURCE LINE, so the sentence must stay on ONE line, with a
 *   STRAIGHT apostrophe in Charlotte's — a curly quote or a wrap leaves
 *   the ranking digits outside the stripped string and fails the
 *   superiority category. (Do not write the naked ranking token in this
 *   file, comments included — the linter scans comments too, which is
 *   exactly how this header failed the gate on its first draft.)
 * - Authorized on /services/dermal-fillers and /about ONLY, once per
 *   page (moved off wrinkle-relaxers at the client's direction,
 *   2026-08-18 — DECISIONS same date). Do not render this component
 *   anywhere else.
 * - Pink-500 on noir is the recorded 5.95:1 pair (tokens.css) — passes
 *   AA at any size; display scale here. No shimmer: the glow that moves
 *   lives in exactly two places, and this is not one of them.
 */
---

<aside class="evolus-callout surface" data-surface="noir" aria-label="Evolus recognition">
  <p class="evolus-callout__statement">
    Amy is Charlotte's #1 Evolus provider!
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .evolus-callout {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .evolus-callout__statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.9375rem, 4vw, 2.4375rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ng-pink-500);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
